        <ol>
                    <li id="cf-fn-1">The program is part of Kentucky&rsquo;s Hiring Our Miners Everyday, or H.O.M.E., program, which is housed within the Eastern Kentucky Concentrated Employment Program and is funded by an emergency grant from the U.S. Department of Labor.
                        <a href="#cf-fn-ret-1" aria-label="Return from footnote 1.">Return to 1</a>
                    </li>
                    <li id="cf-fn-2">The Cleveland Fed&rsquo;s median CPI inflation rate is available at&nbsp;<a href="/indicators-and-data/median-cpi">https://clevelandfed.org/our-research/indicators-and-data/median-cpi.aspx</a>.
                        <a href="#cf-fn-ret-2" aria-label="Return from footnote 2.">Return to 2</a>
                    </li>
                    <li id="cf-fn-3">The Cleveland Fed&rsquo;s inflation expectations measure is available at&nbsp;<a href="/indicators-and-data/inflation-expectations">https://clevelandfed.org/our-research/indicators-and-data/inflation-expectations.aspx</a>.
                        <a href="#cf-fn-ret-3" aria-label="Return from footnote 3.">Return to 3</a>
                    </li>
                    <li id="cf-fn-4">For further discussion of trends in the energy, steel, and auto sectors in the Cleveland Federal Reserve District, see Mark E. Schweitzer, Robert Sadowski, and Christopher Vecchio, &ldquo;Three Trends Influencing the Region&rsquo;s Growth,&rdquo; Forefront, Federal Reserve Bank of Cleveland, January 15, 2016, available&nbsp;<a href="/publications/forefront/2016/ff-v6n03">https://www.clevelandfed.org/newsroom-and-events/publications/forefront/ff-v6n03/ff-20160115-v6n03-three-trends-influencing-the-regions-growth.aspx</a>.
                        <a href="#cf-fn-ret-4" aria-label="Return from footnote 4.">Return to 4</a>
                    </li>
                    <li id="cf-fn-5">The Cleveland Fed&rsquo;s Community Stabilization Index is a composite index that provides a relative measure of local housing market conditions at the ZIP code level, with a particular focus on recovery potential. It is available at&nbsp;<a href="/community-development">https://www.clevelandfed.org/en/community-development/community-stabilization-index.aspx</a>.
                        <a href="#cf-fn-ret-5" aria-label="Return from footnote 5.">Return to 5</a>
